  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Concern Worldwide for the design and set up of a consortium of International Non-Governmental Organisations to deliver increased access to water, sanitation and hygiene in the DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Concern Worldwide for the design and set up of a consortium of International Non-Governmental Organisations to deliver increased access to water, sanitation and hygiene in the DRC is a component of Increasing sustainable access to water sanitation and hygiene in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;257,064. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation.</narrative>
